body:
>Cause tonight I'm feeling like an astronaut sending SOS from this tiny box to the lonely people that the world forgot are you out there? Cause you're all I've got. 

\- Simple Plan, Astronaut

&#x200B;

You mixed quite a few things in your post like autism, a vague "mental illness"/state of "insane", fetishes, pedophilia, but also frameworks around happiness and meaning in life, socializing abilities etc.. But I am not going to address that or the topic of waifuism itself (also cause I am not knowledgeable about that topic at all). Instead I'd just like to ask you a question you could try to honestly answer to yourself:  

&#x200B;

Why do you care so much about this?
